      "name": "Applying system.md",
      "filePath": "architectures/Applying system.md",
      "summary": "Specification for the developer/staff application flow: an Apply button in the apply ticket triggers a 10-question form with a role selector and terms agreement, followed by the commission rules (60/40 server-referred vs 90/10 direct-client split, multi-developer division, $100 minimum, and general payment rules).",
